{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/769746d5675d2cabd865973768fb4607.avif?t=1759305707\" width=720 height=478 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/cd135591fd1574246315e90889c989af.avif?t=1759305707\" width=502 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Goddess of Mischief, Loki, finds a cursed swamp that isn't of her doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deciding to make this curse her own, she ventures out to explore and conquer the marshland and its inhabbitants for her own machinations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/f8b084e82020b51bfa8bf573a5bae439.avif?t=1759305707\" width=720 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon entering the cursed lands, she finds her powers seriously weakened, and the creatures of the swamp to be uncooperative and even hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Loki beat sense into the goblin tribes and transform the malediction into a power of her own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/a5831d575620a71128ed73b80d3843db.avif?t=1759305707\" width=502 height=108 /></span><br>- A very VERY difficult, unusual RPG Maker meets turn-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complex combat system that punishes skill spam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemies that can telegraph their attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Loki needs to use smart tactical counter-attacks based on the situation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No grinding (you can avoid unnecessary fights)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468280?t=1759305707","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468280?t=1759305707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/ba888a09d01bbf4f9075f27a95e83f687672e8ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759305707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/ba888a09d01bbf4f9075f27a95e83f687672e8ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759305707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Deathblight Jormungandr contains the following content:\r\n-Risque outfits, sexual comments and adult situations\r\n-Sex Scenes (Non consensual sex, sex with goblins, spider monsters, beasts and tentacle monsters.\r\n-All characters in Deathblight Jormungandr are 18+ and over"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3470130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/769746d5675d2cabd865973768fb4607.avif?t=1759305707\" width=720 height=478 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/cd135591fd1574246315e90889c989af.avif?t=1759305707\" width=502 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Goddess of Mischief, Loki, finds a cursed swamp that isn't of her doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deciding to make this curse her own, she ventures out to explore and conquer the marshland and its inhabbitants for her own machinations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/f8b084e82020b51bfa8bf573a5bae439.avif?t=1759305707\" width=720 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon entering the cursed lands, she finds her powers seriously weakened, and the creatures of the swamp to be uncooperative and even hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Loki beat sense into the goblin tribes and transform the malediction into a power of her own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/a5831d575620a71128ed73b80d3843db.avif?t=1759305707\" width=502 height=108 /></span><br>- A very VERY difficult, unusual RPG Maker meets turn-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complex combat system that punishes skill spam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemies that can telegraph their attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Loki needs to use smart tactical counter-attacks based on the situation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No grinding (you can avoid unnecessary fights)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Projekt Wolfenstahl"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/header.jpg?t=1759305707","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3468280/1106790062/71db18745a6707ea02bfdf28b82799e7a8d17292/1752330749/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752376381","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3468280/1106790062/71db18745a6707ea02bfdf28b82799e7a8d17292/1752330749/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752376381","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3468280/1106790062/71db18745a6707ea02bfdf28b82799e7a8d17292/1752330749/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752376381","id":257109152,"